{"schema":"hsr-dialogue.v1","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-99","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","textReferenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","sourceIds":["event-tourn-99"],"missing":0,"rows":[{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-talk-403816040-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-99","missionId":"event-tourn-99","mission":"완•매 (3)","scene":"완•매 (3)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"물속에서 뭔가가 헤엄치는 듯한 꾸르륵거리는 소리가 들린다. 천천히 뒤를 돌아보니 익숙한 얼굴이 실험대 앞에 엎드려 있다. 그녀는 배양 캡슐에 양분을 주입하고 있다. 기이하고 아름다운 생령이 기쁨을 표현하듯 빙글빙글 회전한다","talkId":403816040,"textHash":"6784753520156345187","source":"tournHandBookEvent:99/talk-403816040","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4f03745e46aafaa0","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-talk-403816041-line"],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其三）","bwikiRevision":61725,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12926","bwikiMission":"완•매 (3)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-talk-403816041-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-99","missionId":"event-tourn-99","mission":"완•매 (3)","scene":"완•매 (3)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「타이밍 좋네」 완•매는 하던 일을 멈추고 재미있다는 듯 당신을 바라본다. 「이 작품들은 곧 완성될 거야. 하지만 아쉽게도, 넌 슬라이스 속에 오래 머물 수는 없어」","talkId":403816041,"textHash":"4002622408427184542","source":"tournHandBookEvent:99/talk-403816041","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4f03745e46aafaa0","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-talk-403816042-line"],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其三）","bwikiRevision":61725,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12926","bwikiMission":"완•매 (3)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-talk-403816042-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-99","missionId":"event-tourn-99","mission":"완•매 (3)","scene":"완•매 (3)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"배양 캡슐 속 조그만 녀석은 그녀의 행동을 흉내내며 수면으로 몸을 내밀고 당신들의 목소리를 들으려 한다","talkId":403816042,"textHash":"5599009878745568192","source":"tournHandBookEvent:99/talk-403816042","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4f03745e46aafaa0","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-talk-403816043-line"],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其三）","bwikiRevision":61725,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12926","bwikiMission":"완•매 (3)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-talk-403816043-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-99","missionId":"event-tourn-99","mission":"완•매 (3)","scene":"완•매 (3)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「어쩌면… 녀석들이 이 시뮬레이션 우주에 기쁨을 가져다줄지도 몰라」 그녀는 눈을 내리깔고 손가락으로 물속에 있는 어리둥절한 창조물을 건드린다","talkId":403816043,"textHash":"2912214926706671382","source":"tournHandBookEvent:99/talk-403816043","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"4f03745e46aafaa0","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其三）","bwikiRevision":61725,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12926","bwikiMission":"완•매 (3)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-talk-403816050-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-99","missionId":"event-tourn-99","mission":"완•매 (3)","scene":"완•매 (3)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「변화는 우주의 정상적인 상태이고, 어떤 학자도 불변하는 데이터를 기대하지 않아. 유전자 깊은 곳의 유전 변이, 충돌 실험의 오차 데이터…」 완•매는 침착하게 실험실 안의 작품들을 바라보며 옅은 미소를 짓는다. 「과학은 그런 놀라움을 배척하지 않아. 그것들은 종종 돌파구를 의미하거든」","talkId":403816050,"textHash":"5476124778768147532","source":"tournHandBookEvent:99/talk-403816050","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ae6edc21ec37e486","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-talk-403816057-line"],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其三）","bwikiRevision":61725,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12926","bwikiMission":"완•매 (3)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-talk-403816057-line","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-99","missionId":"event-tourn-99","mission":"완•매 (3)","scene":"완•매 (3)","type":"dialogue","speaker":"시뮬레이션 우주","text":"「자, 널 위해 준비한 서프라이즈를 가져가」","talkId":403816057,"textHash":"15933841437491539643","source":"tournHandBookEvent:99/talk-403816057","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"ae6edc21ec37e486","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其三）","bwikiRevision":61725,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12926","bwikiMission":"완•매 (3)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-text-711642163663749071-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-99","missionId":"event-tourn-99","mission":"완•매 (3)","scene":"완•매 (3)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"상상을 초월하는 서프라이즈다","talkId":null,"textHash":"711642163663749071","source":"tournHandBookEvent:99/text-711642163663749071","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"68d1631f2200f759","bwikiNextIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-text-11259985090455506533-effect"],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其三）","bwikiRevision":61725,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12926","bwikiMission":"완•매 (3)"},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-text-11259985090455506533-effect","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-99","missionId":"event-tourn-99","mission":"완•매 (3)","scene":"완•매 (3)","type":"narration","speaker":"","text":"★3 방정식 1개를 획득하고, 모든 방정식이 전개될 때까지 보유 중인 방정식에 필요한 랜덤 축복을 획득한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"11259985090455506533","source":"tournHandBookEvent:99/text-11259985090455506533","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene":"68d1631f2200f759","bwikiNextIds":[],"bwikiPage":"阮•梅（其三）","bwikiRevision":61725,"bwikiMissionId":"bwiki-page-12926","bwikiMission":"완•매 (3)","bwikiReplyToIds":["divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-text-711642163663749071-choice"]},{"id":"divergent-universe-event-tourn-99-text-6723031073948770303-choice","entryId":"divergent-universe","chapterId":"event-tourn-99","missionId":"event-tourn-99","mission":"완•매 (3)","scene":"완•매 (3)","type":"choice","speaker":"","text":"스크루룸의 과제에 내용을 더 추가한다","talkId":null,"textHash":"6723031073948770303","source":"tournHandBookEvent:99/text-6723031073948770303","flowStatus":"review","bwikiStatus":"cached","bwikiScene"